// Q-167 A made-up subdomain is a 500 that names `with_tenant`, where a site with no such customer would say 404: every scanner fills the error log, and the status tells who is a tenant
// mode: script
// script: steps.sh
// open-when: there is no tenant
// fixed-when: unknown tenant: 404
// From FEEDBACK20.md §Q-167 (found on 9e8c2fb).

tenant_from("example.com")
db.open("data/{tenant}.db")

route GET / = db.query("select 1 as one")
